8,0,1,talk,George,,Good day. I believe a calm approach is best. Let us see how the first night unfolds.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! A mystery game! I'm gonna find the bad guy first! Hehe, good luck everyone!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Toshio, you're very quiet! Are you nervous, or just thinking hard?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,It is early. Silence can be a strategy or simply a personality trait. Let's not rush to judgment.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Toshio,,I am simply observing. There is no need to rush my words.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,George,,I agree with Victoria. Let us not jump to conclusions based on a few seconds of silence.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Maybe Toshio-san is hiding a secret! Or maybe he's just sleepy! Wake up, Toshio-san!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"Haha, Sakura is so energetic! I wonder who the Seer is. They have a big job tonight!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,Indeed. The Seer's information will be the cornerstone of our survival. We must protect them.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"If the Seer reveals themselves too early, they become a target. Caution is necessary.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,George,,"A wise point, Toshio. Discretion is often the safest path in these matters.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,I want to be a detective! I'll look for clues everywhere! Who do you guys think looks suspicious?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Kenji,,I don't think anyone looks suspicious yet! Let's just have a great game and be honest!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Victoria,,Honesty is a luxury in this game. I will be watching everyone's reactions tomorrow.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
