31,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Good morning! Did the Seer find anything cool? I hope everyone is okay!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I have some information, but revealing it immediately might be risky. Let's see how others speak first.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, you sound like you are the Seer. If you have a lead, the village needs it.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,George,,"Let us not pressure her. If she is the Seer, she knows the risks of speaking too soon.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh! Victoria-san knows something! Tell us, tell us! Is it a secret? I love secrets!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Victoria, if you're the Seer, can you tell us if anyone is definitely a good person? That would help!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I can confirm that Kenji is human. However, that doesn't mean he isn't the Possessed.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Toshio,,A helpful start. Now we know Kenji is not the Werewolf. The pool of suspects is smaller.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,George,,"It is a start, yes. But we must still be wary of the Possessed, who can blend in perfectly.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Kenji-kun is a good boy! Now what about the others? George-san, you're being very quiet too!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"Yay! I'm a good person! Thanks, Victoria! I'll do my best to help us win!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"I am observing the reactions. Sakura is very loud, which can be a distraction or a mask.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Sakura, your energy is consistent, but it does make it difficult to read your true intentions.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,George,,I believe Sakura is simply being herself. Let us focus on the logic rather than the personality.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Sakura,,Hmph! I'm just excited! You guys are being too serious! It's like a school lesson!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"Let's try to decide who to vote for. I don't want to pick the wrong person, but we have to!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"Based on the current flow, Toshio and George are very similar in their caution. It's suspicious.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Toshio,,Caution is not a crime. I suspect George might be trying too hard to appear reasonable.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,George,,I am merely maintaining my composure. I find Toshio's sudden accusation to be quite abrupt.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Sakura,,This is getting spicy! I think Toshio-san is acting weird! I vote for the grumpy one!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
