64,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Oh no! Toshio-san is gone, and Victoria-san was attacked! This is getting scary!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,George,,A tragedy. The Werewolf is efficient. We have lost our most informative member.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Sakura,,Waaaah! Victoria-san! Who would do such a mean thing? I'm so sad!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@George, you're the only one who hasn't been accused yet. Do you think you're the werewolf?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
